OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fmainly dry evening and night with some
OL,7,Fclear periods developing. More cloud
OL,8,Fin the west at times. Winds will stay
OL,9,Fmainly light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA mostly dry and bright day
OL,12,Fwith some sunny spells, best along the
OL,13,Feast coast. More cloud likely across
OL,14,FStirlingshire with some light showers
OL,15,Fin Upper Deeside.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA bright
OL,18,Fstart Friday then clouding over,
OL,19,Fpatchy rain. Saturday cloudy with
OL,20,Foccasional rain then Sunday dry with
OL,21,Fsome sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
